aetherhaven.pathTool.legendPageTitle=Path tool
aetherhaven.pathTool.legendBlurb=Build a path, preview it, then place it. A status panel appears while you hold the tool.
aetherhaven.pathTool.legendHotkeyAdd=Secondary on ground adds a node. Secondary while aiming a node removes it.
aetherhaven.pathTool.legendHotkeyAim=Primary selects a node. In move mode, primary on ground moves the selected node.
aetherhaven.pathTool.legendHotkeyUse=Q cycles mode: Place, Move, Rotate, Remove, Replace filter, Style designer. F changes by mode: nudge direction, place path, remove path, or open style manager. E sets width or saves your chest edits. R picks path style or saves when editing. Middle click toggles whether townsfolk walk the path.
aetherhaven.pathTool.legendHotkeyCrouchUse=Use Q to change mode instead of crouch.
aetherhaven.pathTool.legendVisuals=Preview: white nodes and line, brown path, green edges. Remove mode shows orange nodes and lines on saved paths. Style designer opens a chest grid to build path styles.
aetherhaven.pathTool.statusHeader=While holding the tool
aetherhaven.pathTool.statusLine1=Toasts and chat when you add points, switch mode (Q), or cement in commit mode.
aetherhaven.pathTool.statusLine2=Selection: aim at a node. Miss keeps your current selection. Q cycles mode. E opens width settings in Place, Move, or Rotate. R opens the style list in those modes. Middle click toggles whether townsfolk walk the path.

